    {
      "id": "u_92923591a36027ea7ea81931_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Task Manager manages outstanding (TODO) tasks and finished tasks (non-empty doneDate attribute). Outstanding tasks are further categorized by location and arbitrary tags - whenever you change tag attribute in the task note, this task is then automatically moved to appropriate location.",
